Package: methylomeTools
Type: Package
Title: Methylation Analysis, Parallel Modeling and Genomic Visualization
Version: 0.1.0.9003
Author: Cam Lunn
Maintainer: Cam Lunn <cameron.lunn@nyulangone.org>
Description: Utilities for methylation matrix preparation, surrogate variable
    analysis, parallel DSS modeling, comb-p region calling and CpG and region
    visualization. Includes optional human hg38 annotation and read-only CpG
    metadata database access. Development version.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: grid, parallel, dplyr, rlang, stats, utils, graphics, grDevices, methods,
    GenomicRanges, GenomeInfoDb, IRanges, S4Vectors, BiocGenerics,
    SummarizedExperiment, bsseq, sva, ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), scales,
    tibble, tidyr
Suggests: ENmix, annotatr, AnnotationDbi, GenomicFeatures,
    TxDb.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg38.knownGene, org.Hs.eg.db,
    DBI, RSQLite, matrixStats, DelayedArray, DelayedMatrixStats,
    RhpcBLASctl, irlba, Cairo, parallelly, DSS, ggrepel,
    patchwork, mgcv, testthat (>= 3.0.0), BiocManager
Config/testthat/edition: 3
